§§ `37. Composition of offences`

-- Composition Facts: compoundable, maximum fine, sum proposed, sum paid.
GIVEN maxfine IS A NUMBER
      sum IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Composition Facts`
`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` maxfine `compounded for` sum MEANS
    `Composition Facts` OF TRUE, maxfine, sum, FALSE

#ASSERT `the most that may be collected in composition` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 10_000 `compounded for` 0) EQUALS 5_000
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected in composition` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 5_000 `compounded for` 0) EQUALS 2_500
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected in composition` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 1_000 `compounded for` 0) EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected in composition` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 20_000 `compounded for` 0) EQUALS 5_000
#ASSERT `the most that may be collected in composition` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 10_002 `compounded for` 0) EQUALS 5_000
#ASSERT `the offence may be compounded for the sum proposed` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 10_000 `compounded for` 5_000)
#ASSERT NOT `the offence may be compounded for the sum proposed` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 10_000 `compounded for` 5_001)
#ASSERT `the offence may be compounded for the sum proposed` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 5_000 `compounded for` 2_500)
#ASSERT NOT `the offence may be compounded for the sum proposed` (`a compoundable offence with maximum fine` 5_000 `compounded for` 2_501)
#ASSERT NOT `the offence may be compounded for the sum proposed` (`Composition Facts` OF FALSE, 10_000, 100, FALSE)
#ASSERT `no further proceedings are to be taken against the person in respect of the offence` (`Composition Facts` OF TRUE, 10_000, 100, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `no further proceedings are to be taken against the person in respect of the offence` (`Composition Facts` OF TRUE, 10_000, 100, FALSE)
#ASSERT REFUSED `no regulations under section 43(2)(j) prescribing compoundable offences are encoded in this model`

