§§ `39. Enforcement of duty to make returns`

-- Enforcement Facts: failed to comply, notice to comply served, date served, made good, date made good, request to amend served,
-- date served, date complied, s 27(7) request made, failed to take the steps, date the court considers the application, the court,
-- the Registrar applies.
`non-compliance made good on the 14th day` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, TRUE,  JUST (YMD 2026 3 15), FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`non-compliance made good on the 15th day` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, TRUE,  JUST (YMD 2026 3 16), FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`non-compliance never made good, court sits on the 14th day` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 15, `a District Court`, TRUE
`non-compliance never made good, court sits on the 15th day` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 16, `a Magistrate's Court`, TRUE
`no notice to comply served` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`a resubmission request ignored` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`a resubmission request met on the 14th day` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 15), FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`a resubmission request met on the 15th day` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 16), FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`a section 27(7) request ignored` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, TRUE,  TRUE,  YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`a section 27(7) request met` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, TRUE,  FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `a District Court`, TRUE
`a failure taken to the wrong court` MEANS `Enforcement Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  YMD 2026 3 1, FALSE, NOTHING, FALSE, YMD 2026 3 1, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2026 4 1, `any other court`, TRUE
