§§ `40. Offences by bodies corporate, etc.`

-- Body Offence Facts: kind of body, offence by the body proved, the person's role, consent or connivance, neglect.
`a director who connived, in a company` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`, TRUE, `an officer of the body corporate`, TRUE,  FALSE
`a director who was negligent, in a company` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`, TRUE, `an officer of the body corporate`, FALSE, TRUE
`a director who neither connived nor neglected` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`, TRUE, `an officer of the body corporate`, FALSE, FALSE
`a director who connived, though the body's offence is not proved` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`, FALSE, `an officer of the body corporate`, TRUE,  FALSE
`a managing member who connived, in a member-managed company` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`, TRUE, `a member of a body corporate whose affairs are managed by its members, acting in connection with the member's functions of management`, TRUE, FALSE
`an outsider who connived, in a company` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a body corporate, including a limited liability partnership`, TRUE, `none of those`, TRUE,  FALSE
`a partner who connived, in a firm` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a firm`, TRUE, `a partner of the firm, including a person purporting to act as a partner`, TRUE, FALSE
`a partner who was negligent, in a firm` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a firm`, TRUE, `a partner of the firm, including a person purporting to act as a partner`, FALSE, TRUE
`an officer who connived, in a firm` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `a firm`, TRUE, `an officer of the body corporate`, TRUE, FALSE
`a committee member who connived, in a club` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `an unincorporated association other than a firm`, TRUE, `an officer of the unincorporated association or a member of its governing body`, TRUE, FALSE
`a partner who connived, in a club` MEANS `Body Offence Facts` OF `an unincorporated association other than a firm`, TRUE, `a partner of the firm, including a person purporting to act as a partner`, TRUE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a director who connived, in a company`
#ASSERT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a director who was negligent, in a company`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a director who neither connived nor neglected`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a director who connived, though the body's offence is not proved`
#ASSERT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a managing member who connived, in a member-managed company`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `an outsider who connived, in a company`
#ASSERT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a partner who connived, in a firm`
#ASSERT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a partner who was negligent, in a firm`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `an officer who connived, in a firm`
#ASSERT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a committee member who connived, in a club`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is guilty of the offence as well as the body` `a partner who connived, in a club`
#ASSERT REFUSED `no regulations under section 40(6) modifying section 40 for bodies formed outside Singapore are encoded in this model`

