§§ `43. Regulations`

#ASSERT REFUSED `no regulations under section 43 are encoded in this model`

§§ `45. Saving and transitional provisions`

-- Transitional Registration Facts: registered under the repealed Act before 3 Jan 2016, the date it would have expired,
-- application pending, a reservation under the old s 13(3) had not expired, the date it would have expired.
`registered under the repealed Act until 30 June 2016` MEANS `Transitional Registration Facts` OF TRUE,  YMD 2016 6 30, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2016 1 3
`a reservation running to 15 February 2016` MEANS `Transitional Registration Facts` OF FALSE, YMD 2016 1 3, FALSE, TRUE,  YMD 2016 2 15
`a reservation that had already expired` MEANS `Transitional Registration Facts` OF FALSE, YMD 2016 1 3, FALSE, FALSE, YMD 2015 12 1

#ASSERT `the person is treated as registered under section 8` `registered under the repealed Act until 30 June 2016`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is treated as registered under section 8` `a reservation running to 15 February 2016`
#ASSERT `the date the treated registration expires` `registered under the repealed Act until 30 June 2016` EQUALS YMD 2016 6 30
#ASSERT `the reservation is treated as a reservation under this Act` `a reservation running to 15 February 2016`
#ASSERT NOT `the reservation is treated as a reservation under this Act` `a reservation that had already expired`
#ASSERT `the date the transitional reservation expires` `a reservation running to 15 February 2016` EQUALS YMD 2016 2 15
#ASSERT `the pending application is treated as an application under the corresponding provisions of this Act` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the pending application is treated as an application under the corresponding provisions of this Act` FALSE

-- Local Manager Facts: registered as a local manager under the old regulations, notice that A was not appointed,
-- notice that A does not meet s 11(2).
#ASSERT `the local manager is treated as the authorised representative from 3 January 2016` (`Local Manager Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the local manager is treated as the authorised representative from 3 January 2016` (`Local Manager Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the local manager is treated as the authorised representative from 3 January 2016` (`Local Manager Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the local manager is treated as the authorised representative from 3 January 2016` (`Local Manager Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)

-- Transitional Residence Facts: treated as registered under s 45(2), all reside outside Singapore on 3 January 2016,
-- s 45(4) applies, an authorised representative was appointed within 30 days.
#ASSERT `an authorised representative had to be appointed within 30 days after 3 January 2016` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `an authorised representative had to be appointed within 30 days after 3 January 2016` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `an authorised representative had to be appointed within 30 days after 3 January 2016` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `an authorised representative had to be appointed within 30 days after 3 January 2016` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `the last day for appointing an authorised representative under section 45(5)` EQUALS YMD 2016 2 2
#ASSERT `the Registrar may cancel, and each is guilty of an offence, under section 45(5)` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may cancel, and each is guilty of an offence, under section 45(5)` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may cancel, and each is guilty of an offence, under section 45(5)` (`Transitional Residence Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE)
